Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: the Secretary General is hereby requested to insert into the records the questions of the Honorable Eli Manggagawa

1383
02:04:35,140 --> 02:04:39,420
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: and the Committee on Appropriations through its Senior Vice Chair, the Honorable Abet Garcia,

1384
