Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: Mr. Speaker, may I acknowledge the heads and officials of the Presidential Management Staff headed by Secretary Elaine T. [unclear], Undersecretary Mark R. Jimenez, Undersecretary Honey Rose B. Mercado,

1393
02:06:59,640 --> 02:07:16,640
Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: Undersecretary Rodulfo John Robert C. Palatao IV, Assistant Secretary Juan Manuel M. Reyes, Director Lizelle May Galenzoga, Director Karen Gail B. Feble.

1394
