Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: The Honorable Garcia is now recognized. Please proceed.

1400
02:08:01,640 --> 02:08:10,470
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. This representation is ready to answer questions with regards to the 2027 budget of the Presidential Management Staff.

1401
02:08:10,480 --> 02:08:11,100
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Majority Leader?

1402
