Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize Honorable Marcelino Libanan, Minority Leader, to interpolate the budget of the Presidential Management Staff.

1403
02:08:24,280 --> 02:08:28,280
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: The Honorable Libanan is now recognized. Please proceed, Honorable Minority Leader.

1404
02:08:28,380 --> 02:08:50,520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Mr. Speaker, there being no interpolator on the part of the Minority to the Office of the Presidential Management Staff, I hereby move that we terminate the period for interpolation and debate on the Office of the Presidential Management Staff.

1405
02:08:51,180 --> 02:08:52,140
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: So moved, Mr. Speaker.

1406
