Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: There's a motion by the Minority Leader. What does the Majority say?

1407
02:08:56,460 --> 02:08:56,500
Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

1408
02:08:58,380 --> 02:09:05,520
Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: In the report of Majority, we join the Minority in the motion to terminate the period of interpolation on the proposed budget of the Presidential Management Staff.

1409
02:09:06,060 --> 02:09:14,080
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: The joint motion of the Minority and the Majority to terminate the budget of the Office of the Presidential Management Staff.

1410
02:09:14,200 --> 02:09:16,100
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Is there any objection? Chair, there is none.

1411
02:09:16,700 --> 02:09:18,040
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: The motion is now approved.

1412
02:09:19,920 --> 02:09:22,780
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Congratulations to the Presidential Management Staff.

1413
