Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang buong stakeholders sa mga HEIs ay dapat kasama sa pagtataguyod ng mga ligtas na espasyo

2534
03:16:46,140 --> 03:16:49,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ating mga pamantasan at kolehyo.

2535
03:16:50,080 --> 03:16:53,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kari po bang malaman kung meron ba kayong particular line item

2536
03:16:53,980 --> 03:16:59,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matiyak na walang maiiwan na HEIs sa kagustuhan natin

2537
03:16:59,980 --> 03:17:06,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na mapatupad ang CHED Memorandum Order No. 18, Series of 2026?

2538
03:17:07,100 --> 03:17:11,380
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: To begin with, meron po silang in-issue na CMO No. 1,

2539
03:17:11,500 --> 03:17:17,000
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: but of course, ongoing ang CODI training nila as well.

2540
03:17:17,760 --> 03:17:19,980
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And they will just re-issue another one.

2541
03:17:20,080 --> 03:17:25,540
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Sir Memo, to follow up, yung pong mga non-compliant pa po.

2542
03:17:28,240 --> 03:17:29,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

2543
03:17:29,800 --> 03:17:35,520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, sa CODI training, just for an update,

2544
03:17:35,520 --> 03:17:40,740
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: ang Visayas okay na, ang Mindanao is scheduled for October 6-8,

2545
03:17:40,860 --> 03:17:44,120
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and Luzon is timetabled for November.

2546
03:17:45,720 --> 03:17:47,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

2547
03:17:47,200 --> 03:17:49,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nakasaad din sa naturang CMO,

2548
03:17:50,080 --> 03:17:56,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na dapat may konsultasyon sa mga estudyante, sa faculty, sa stakeholders

2549
03:17:56,760 --> 03:18:03,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating sa pagtatatag ng gender and disability sensitive rules and regulations.

2550
03:18:03,580 --> 03:18:06,140
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, yes, our Honorable Colleague.

2551
03:18:06,240 --> 03:18:09,520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: As mentioned earlier, consultation is being done.

2552
03:18:10,020 --> 03:18:13,160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, natapos na po yung lahat ng ibang region.

2553
03:18:13,280 --> 03:18:16,940
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Dalawa na lang po, pending namin, Luzon and NCR.

2554
03:18:20,080 --> 03:18:25,780
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Sorry, Region 11 and NCR.

2555
03:18:27,120 --> 03:18:31,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

2556
03:18:31,380 --> 03:18:35,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, nais ko pong magtanong tungkol sa guidelines,

2557
03:18:35,700 --> 03:18:40,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa policy ng CHED pagdating sa pag-aaproba ng pagtataas ng tuition

2558
03:18:40,720 --> 03:18:44,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at iba't iba pang mga bayarin sa paaralan.

2559
03:18:44,380 --> 03:18:50,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang gumagabay na CMO na may kinalaman,

2560
03:18:50,080 --> 03:18:53,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay yung CHED Memorandum No. 3 Series of 2012 pa rin po ba?

2561
03:18:54,580 --> 03:19:00,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O meron bang mga bagong pinapatupad ngayon ng CHED

2562
03:19:00,400 --> 03:19:04,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matiyak na talagang sa panahon din ng krisis

2563
03:19:04,480 --> 03:19:11,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay natitiyak natin yung karapatan sa edukasyon ng ating mga estudyante

2564
03:19:11,660 --> 03:19:20,150
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: habang natutulungan din yung ating mga pinakamaliliit na mga paaralan na

2565
03:19:20,180 --> 03:19:23,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Makapagpatuloy pa rin sa kanila hong operations.

2566
03:19:28,220 --> 03:19:28,940
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes.

2567
03:19:30,780 --> 03:19:34,540
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Tapos ng consultation with the TWG.

2568
03:19:35,500 --> 03:19:38,580
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Kasama dito ang ating private schools.

2569
03:19:39,260 --> 03:19:41,120
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And i-finalize na lang po.

2570
03:19:41,240 --> 03:19:46,720
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: But if need be, willing po magbigay ng copy ng draft sa inyo po.

2571
03:19:47,720 --> 03:19:49,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maaring nyo po ba kaming balitaan kung...

2572
03:19:50,080 --> 03:19:57,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ilang mga eskwelahan po ang magtataas ng kanilang tuition and other school fees para sa taong ito at sa susunod?

2573
03:19:59,740 --> 03:20:03,100
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Would it be okay to submit na lang po yung data sa inyo po?

2574
03:20:03,760 --> 03:20:06,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, a distinguished sponsor.

2575
03:20:06,540 --> 03:20:12,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At hihingi na rin po natin, matagal na rin pong panawagan ito ng mga kabataan,

2576
03:20:12,380 --> 03:20:15,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating mga stakeholders sa sektor ng edukasyon,

2577
03:20:15,680 --> 03:20:21,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na dapat ma-review yung pag-aaproba ng other school fees,

2578
03:20:21,500 --> 03:20:26,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung mga bayarin, dagdag pa sa tuition na binabayaran ng mga estudyante.

2579
03:20:26,740 --> 03:20:35,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sa ngayon po, nakikita pa rin natin na nagpapatuloy yung paniningil ng patong-patong na fees

2580
03:20:35,120 --> 03:20:44,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na hindi po natitiyak ng mga estudyante na gagamit pa talaga ito diretso para sa benefit namin mga learners

2581
03:20:44,340 --> 03:20:45,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o ng mga estudyante.

2582
03:20:45,680 --> 03:20:51,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napupunta ba talaga yung nararapat na percentage ng tuition and other school fee increases

2583
03:20:51,200 --> 03:20:58,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa pagtataas ng sahod, ng benepisyo, para sa welfare ng mga teachers?

2584
03:20:58,540 --> 03:21:02,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yan po yung mga katanungan na dapat talaga magtulak sa CHED.

2585
03:21:02,780 --> 03:21:10,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po reviewhin, pero repasuhin at pagtibayin ang ating CHED memorandum order

2586
03:21:10,480 --> 03:21:14,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na gumagabay sa pag-aaproba ng tuition and other school fees.

2587
03:21:14,080 --> 03:21:15,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

2588
03:21:15,680 --> 03:21:19,780
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Kasama po siya dun po sa consultative meeting.

2589
03:21:19,920 --> 03:21:23,460
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Natapos na po yung sa public schools, ongoing po yung sa private schools.

2590
03:21:23,620 --> 03:21:29,520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So kasama naman po siya together with the TWG para, pangkalahatan na po siya.

2591
03:21:30,380 --> 03:21:34,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat, Distinguished Sponsor.

2592
03:21:34,960 --> 03:21:37,280
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you, the Honorable Elago. Majority Leader.

2593
03:21:37,860 --> 03:21:43,620
Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize Honorable Antonio Tino of Teachers Partylist

2594
03:21:43,620 --> 03:21:45,520
Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: to interpolate the budget.

2595
03:21:45,680 --> 03:21:51,220
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The Honorable Antonio Tino of Partylist Act Teachers is recognized.

2596
03:21:51,620 --> 03:21:52,140
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Please proceed.

2597
03:21:59,760 --> 03:22:01,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

2598
03:22:02,820 --> 03:22:13,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Speaker, marami pong katanungan natin ay mas appropriate na itanong para sa SUC budget.

2599
03:22:13,860 --> 03:22:15,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So I will ask them later.

2600
03:22:15,680 --> 03:22:20,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So a few questions regarding the policies of CHED.

2601
03:22:21,560 --> 03:22:26,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of course, alam natin na katulong ang CHED.

2602
03:22:27,620 --> 03:22:34,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madalas po ay katulong ang CHED sa laban para itaas ang budget,

2603
03:22:35,240 --> 03:22:37,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: lalo na sa ating mga state universities and colleges,

2604
03:22:37,980 --> 03:22:40,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at para sa higher education in general.

2605
03:22:41,580 --> 03:22:43,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, I just have a few.

2606
03:22:43,540 --> 03:22:45,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At isa sa mga advokasya po,

2607
03:22:45,680 --> 03:22:52,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng CHED ngayon ay yung pag-develop ng isang composite fee,

2608
03:22:52,800 --> 03:22:59,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: parang standard composite fee for state universities and colleges.

2609
03:23:01,360 --> 03:23:09,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Iba-iba po talaga yung mga tuition fee rates or composite fee rates

2610
03:23:09,220 --> 03:23:13,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that the more, the 100, ilan na ba tayo?

2611
03:23:13,840 --> 03:23:15,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 113 or 160?

2612
03:23:15,680 --> 03:23:19,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: State universities and colleges charge.

2613
03:23:20,180 --> 03:23:21,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ayon sa datos,

2614
03:23:22,220 --> 03:23:28,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: there are five state universities that charge 50 pesos or less per unit,

2615
03:23:30,180 --> 03:23:33,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including several in Metro Manila and the Zamboanga Peninsula.

2616
03:23:34,600 --> 03:23:39,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos 32 SUCs charge from 51 pesos to 100 pesos per unit.

2617
03:23:39,680 --> 03:23:44,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Then 101 pesos to 200 pesos per unit,

2618
03:23:44,380 --> 03:23:45,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 57 SUCs.

2619
03:23:45,680 --> 03:23:50,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 201 pesos to 1,000 per unit,

2620
03:23:51,520 --> 03:23:52,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 19 SUCs.

2621
03:23:53,280 --> 03:23:54,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So why does this matter?

2622
03:23:54,620 --> 03:23:57,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: This matters because of the,

2623
03:23:57,980 --> 03:24:05,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: consequently, the varying levels of subsidy provided to state universities and colleges.

2624
03:24:05,900 --> 03:24:08,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So napakalawak po ng range.

2625
03:24:10,820 --> 03:24:14,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, pwede po bang magbigay ng update ang CHED?

2626
03:24:15,680 --> 03:24:23,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: On the work that they have been doing to standardize composite fees

2627
03:24:23,920 --> 03:24:31,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: as a basis for subsidies to state universities and colleges, among others.

2628
03:24:32,320 --> 03:24:32,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano pong status?

2629
03:24:40,560 --> 03:24:44,440
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes.

2630
03:24:45,020 --> 03:24:49,440
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Part of the SGV study, this was included also.

2631
03:24:49,760 --> 03:25:01,440
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And so, with the results of that, the CHED now has many options as its proposal for the different SUCs,

2632
03:25:01,900 --> 03:25:06,780
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: depending on kung ano po yung mapag-usapan na kakayanin po per SUC.

2633
03:25:06,780 --> 03:25:12,120
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Pero marami naman po silang ginawang options as proposals po.

2634
03:25:12,620 --> 03:25:14,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po yung proposals or options?

2635
03:25:15,020 --> 03:25:17,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para malinaw din po sa plenaryo.

2636
03:25:18,060 --> 03:25:18,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

2637
03:25:44,680 --> 03:25:49,940
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Sige po.

2638
03:25:50,380 --> 03:25:56,800
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, if based on SGV, we will be needing 53.7B.

2639
03:25:56,800 --> 03:26:01,920
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: If based on DBM, we will be needing 29.6B.

2640
03:26:02,300 --> 03:26:06,060
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And based on CHED's proposal, we will be needing 4.2.

2641
03:26:06,400 --> 03:26:10,240
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, in the meantime, knowing na lahat po yun na malaking figures,

2642
03:26:10,240 --> 03:26:15,600
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: meron din pong proposal ang CHED for a leveling up scheme.

2643
03:26:17,320 --> 03:26:24,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes, could we hear this leveling up scheme proposed by CHED?

2644
03:26:25,100 --> 03:26:29,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napakahalaga po na malaman ng kongresong ito para baka tugon.

2645
03:26:30,120 --> 03:26:33,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: If ever, leveling up, ibig sabihin pagdagdag,

2646
03:26:34,220 --> 03:26:38,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: step-by-step na pagdagdag sa subsidy sa mga state universities.

2647
03:26:39,260 --> 03:26:40,140
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Sige po.

2648
03:26:40,240 --> 03:26:48,460
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: If it's for SUCs that charge below 250 per unit,

2649
03:26:49,460 --> 03:26:55,900
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: there are 106 of them, then there is a need for 4.2B.

2650
03:26:56,320 --> 03:26:56,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2651
03:26:59,420 --> 03:27:02,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron pa po bang additional info?

2652
03:27:02,640 --> 03:27:03,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun yung pinaka...

2653
03:27:03,480 --> 03:27:09,280
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: For those, for the seven suks who charge 250 and above,

2654
03:27:09,280 --> 03:27:19,360
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: there is a funding needed of 87.4 million.

2655
03:27:20,560 --> 03:27:24,820
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: But yung second po, medyo hindi po okay sa pasok.

2656
03:27:25,740 --> 03:27:26,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2657
03:27:26,300 --> 03:27:26,500
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Oo.

2658
03:27:27,180 --> 03:27:27,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2659
03:27:28,180 --> 03:27:28,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alright.

2660
03:27:29,360 --> 03:27:32,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, parang ganito po, para malinaw.

2661
03:27:32,640 --> 03:27:37,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, sa ngayon, ay binabatay,

2662
03:27:37,640 --> 03:27:45,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nabatay, isang batayan ng BBM para sa subsidy sa mga state universities and colleges

2663
03:27:45,460 --> 03:27:48,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay yung composite fee rate.

2664
03:27:48,420 --> 03:27:48,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

2665
03:27:49,700 --> 03:27:50,120
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, po.

2666
03:27:50,140 --> 03:27:50,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

2667
03:27:51,180 --> 03:27:59,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And in the IRR of the Republic Act 10931, the free, yung UACTEA,

2668
03:27:59,200 --> 03:28:02,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Universal Access to Quality Tertiary Education,

2669
03:28:02,800 --> 03:28:06,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: composite fee refers to an index consisting of a single fee

2670
03:28:06,580 --> 03:28:07,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or a range of three.

2671
03:28:07,640 --> 03:28:11,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it's a range of fees that aggregates the basic costs of teaching

2672
03:28:11,200 --> 03:28:14,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and other fees incidental or related to instruction

2673
03:28:14,300 --> 03:28:17,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: based on the normative cost of a given program.

2674
03:28:18,680 --> 03:28:26,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, tinatakda yan o dinidetermine yan ng bawat board ng mga state university.

2675
03:28:26,600 --> 03:28:30,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi nila, ito yung cost, normative cost of program sa aming school.

2676
03:28:31,660 --> 03:28:33,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung nursing, meron ganitong fee.

2677
03:28:33,920 --> 03:28:36,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung education, ganito, and so on and so forth.

2678
03:28:36,760 --> 03:28:37,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2679
03:28:37,640 --> 03:28:43,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito ang isang basis para sa subsidy na binibigay sa state university

2680
03:28:43,240 --> 03:28:46,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para ma-implement yung free higher education.

2681
03:28:46,900 --> 03:28:50,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, katulad ng nabanggit kanina, iba-iba, wide range.

2682
03:28:50,980 --> 03:28:57,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong below 50 pesos per unit, merong below 250 pesos per unit and so on.

2683
03:28:57,500 --> 03:29:03,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong iba na state universities, 1,000 pesos per unit ang china-charge.

2684
03:29:03,700 --> 03:29:04,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, iba-iba rin yung subsidy.

2685
03:29:05,260 --> 03:29:06,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang proposal na nga po, at tinatakda,

2686
03:29:07,640 --> 03:29:11,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga trabaho, and we appreciate the work being done by CHED under CHERA groupies,

2687
03:29:12,440 --> 03:29:16,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: they're coming up with a standardized normative cost.

2688
03:29:16,740 --> 03:29:24,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And naturally, ang pinakamakikinabang dito, yung mga mababa, yung per unit cost na sinisingel.

2689
03:29:24,580 --> 03:29:24,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

2690
03:29:25,520 --> 03:29:33,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At dapat lang naman, kasi many of those fees, yung mga below 50, parang hindi na na-raise yan

2691
03:29:33,860 --> 03:29:35,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for understandable reasons.

2692
03:29:35,620 --> 03:29:37,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa state university, ayaw mo mag-raise.

2693
03:29:37,640 --> 03:29:38,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang pinakamakikinabang dito, ayaw mo mag-raise ng tuition fee.

2694
03:29:39,260 --> 03:29:39,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

2695
03:29:40,000 --> 03:29:40,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2696
03:29:41,140 --> 03:29:44,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ngayon, ang sinasabi po, may binabanggit kayong SGV.

2697
03:29:46,320 --> 03:29:49,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Just to clarify for the record, ano ba yung SGV?

2698
03:29:55,720 --> 03:29:58,840
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: SGV is the CISEP Gores and Balayo firm.

2699
03:29:59,080 --> 03:29:59,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2700
03:30:00,000 --> 03:30:05,300
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Which has been commissioned by CHED to help them with all these studies.

2701
03:30:05,300 --> 03:30:16,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes. So in other words, kinumission ng CHED, ang SGV, the well-known accounting firm, to come up with a composite fee proposal.

2702
03:30:17,280 --> 03:30:20,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: A standard composite fee proposal. Yun na nga yung binabanggit.

2703
03:30:20,640 --> 03:30:32,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yung sa binanggit niyong minimum scenario, yung composite fee magiging P200 per unit. Tama po ba ako?

2704
03:30:33,500 --> 03:30:34,280
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Hindi po.

2705
03:30:34,460 --> 03:30:35,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sige po, pakicorrect.

2706
03:30:35,680 --> 03:30:37,100
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: The basis…

2707
03:30:37,100 --> 03:30:45,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung binanggit niyo na minimum P4.2 billion nakakailanganin, ano pong basis nun?

2708
03:30:46,760 --> 03:30:48,540
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yung P4 billion?

2709
03:30:48,540 --> 03:30:50,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: P4.2 billion, sabi niyo. Proposal.

2710
03:30:50,640 --> 03:30:51,420
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Proposal ng CHED.

2711
03:30:52,240 --> 03:30:53,680
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Leveling up lang po yun.

2712
03:30:53,760 --> 03:30:54,440
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Leveling up.

2713
03:30:54,500 --> 03:30:54,680
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, it's a leveling up.

2714
03:30:54,680 --> 03:30:55,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meaning to say, what would happen?

2715
03:30:56,460 --> 03:30:57,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: What would happen?

2716
03:31:03,400 --> 03:31:11,020
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: For SUCS collecting below P250 per unit, they will be a… aangat po silang lahat.

2717
03:31:11,220 --> 03:31:13,780
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Aangat to P250 na po.

2718
03:31:14,520 --> 03:31:14,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2719
03:31:15,140 --> 03:31:15,460
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes.

2720
03:31:15,460 --> 03:31:19,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ito. At ilang university ang makikinabang dyan?

2721
03:31:19,960 --> 03:31:20,460
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: One hundred seven.

2722
03:31:20,640 --> 03:31:27,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: One hundred seventy of the one hundred sixteen ba? Ano na ba ang latest?

2723
03:31:27,580 --> 03:31:29,520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: One hundred thirteen.

2724
03:31:29,780 --> 03:31:34,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Oh, one hundred thirteen. One hundred seven of the one hundred thirteen ay makikinabang.

2725
03:31:35,720 --> 03:31:46,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, in other words, kung gagawing P250 per unit na, yung kumbaga standardized composite fee.

2726
03:31:46,460 --> 03:31:50,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, maraming ang mayorya.

2727
03:31:50,640 --> 03:31:51,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Halos lahat.

2728
03:31:51,800 --> 03:31:52,160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes.

2729
03:31:52,440 --> 03:31:56,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Except for six. Except for six.

2730
03:31:57,180 --> 03:31:59,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At universities, hindi makikinabang.

2731
03:31:59,980 --> 03:32:00,900
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Seven SUCS.

2732
03:32:01,220 --> 03:32:05,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Seven ba? One hundred seven. Six lang po. One hundred thirteen eh.

2733
03:32:07,700 --> 03:32:09,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry, one hundred six pala.

2734
03:32:11,880 --> 03:32:16,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry, one hundred SUCS ang makikinabang and seven ang may iwan.

2735
03:32:17,560 --> 03:32:18,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2736
03:32:18,000 --> 03:32:18,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2737
03:32:18,500 --> 03:32:20,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Basta seven ang may iwan.

2738
03:32:20,640 --> 03:32:21,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2739
03:32:21,160 --> 03:32:25,100
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Pero there's also a proposal that they increase by five percent.

2740
03:32:25,620 --> 03:32:27,460
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yung hindi kasama dun sa initial na level.

2741
03:32:27,460 --> 03:32:29,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. So, may increase pa rin makukuha.

2742
03:32:30,000 --> 03:32:32,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. So, basta yun yung point. Gawin ng P250.

2743
03:32:33,340 --> 03:32:39,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At para makuha yan, kailangan dagdagan ng P4.2 billion. Tama po?

2744
03:32:39,740 --> 03:32:42,560
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes. P4.230 billion.

2745
03:32:42,560 --> 03:32:46,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. P4.230 billion pesos.

2746
03:32:47,060 --> 03:32:49,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, of course, sinusuportahan po.

2747
03:32:49,400 --> 03:32:58,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, na ang kinatawang ito, yung gano'ng pagtaas sa subsidy ng mga state universities and colleges.

2748
03:32:58,920 --> 03:33:06,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hiwalay pa to dun sa nire-raise naman ng mga state universities and colleges na free higher education deficiency

2749
03:33:06,560 --> 03:33:13,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for the years, for the current year, 2026, and projected for 2027.

2750
03:33:13,220 --> 03:33:19,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Doon ko na lang po babanggitin yun sa deliberation ng SUCS.

2751
03:33:19,400 --> 03:33:29,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Ngayon, just a policy question here regarding the use of composite fees.

2752
03:33:30,720 --> 03:33:35,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit po ba yan ang ginagamit? Anong basis?

2753
03:33:36,420 --> 03:33:44,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi actually, kung titignan mo yung Republic Act 10931, wala naman na there is no mention whatsoever of composite fees.

2754
03:33:44,020 --> 03:33:47,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it only appears in the IRR.

2755
03:33:48,040 --> 03:33:49,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And earlier, I already mentioned.

2756
03:33:49,400 --> 03:34:02,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Or read into the record, the definition of composite fees as defined in the IRR of Republic Act 10931.

2757
03:34:03,420 --> 03:34:14,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And specifically, para mapabilis po yung discussion natin, yung composite fee ay minandato ang UNIFAS na mag-develop ng composite fee

2758
03:34:14,980 --> 03:34:18,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: as a basis for charging.

2759
03:34:18,400 --> 03:34:19,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As a basis for charging.

2760
03:34:19,400 --> 03:34:26,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Those students who are either not qualified or who opt out of the right to free tertiary education.

2761
03:34:27,160 --> 03:34:33,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba? So, kung hindi ka na-qualified or you opt out voluntarily, tisingilin ka.

2762
03:34:33,500 --> 03:34:40,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ang singil sa iyo ay yung composite fee na dinetermine ng UNIFAS.

2763
03:34:40,840 --> 03:34:41,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

2764
03:34:42,840 --> 03:34:43,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

2765
03:34:43,480 --> 03:34:49,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Wala. Hindi nakalagay sa either sa 10931.

2766
03:34:49,400 --> 03:35:03,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Or sa IRR na yung composite fee ang magiging basis para sa subsidy ng mga higher education institutions.

2767
03:35:03,920 --> 03:35:03,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

2768
03:35:04,920 --> 03:35:08,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It's not. It's nowhere stated there. Pero ngayon, mukhang ganun ang ginagamit.

2769
03:35:09,620 --> 03:35:11,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Tama po ba?

2770
03:35:13,240 --> 03:35:15,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And meron po akong punto rito.

2771
03:35:15,300 --> 03:35:18,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero diba ganun ang nangyayari ngayon?

2772
03:35:19,400 --> 03:35:30,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As we just discussed, yung composite fee, which is helpful in the sense na magkakaroon ng mas mataas na subsidy

2773
03:35:30,460 --> 03:35:33,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang mga state universities and colleges.

2774
03:35:34,240 --> 03:35:40,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: However, my position is, or yung ina-articulate po natin dito, this is inadequate.

2775
03:35:42,380 --> 03:35:43,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi sapat.

2776
03:35:43,040 --> 03:35:46,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Well, for one,

2777
03:35:46,640 --> 03:36:01,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I generally have a reservation nang gagaling po sa posisyon, matagal ng posisyon ng ACT at saka ng iba pang mga party list natin sa makabayan.

2778
03:36:01,280 --> 03:36:16,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And the mass movement in general, ayaw natin ang mag-usap in terms of tuition fees or other fees in relation to free tuition.

2779
03:36:16,640 --> 03:36:19,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit sinusukat mo in terms of fees?

2780
03:36:20,260 --> 03:36:21,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. That's one.

2781
03:36:21,580 --> 03:36:22,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The other one is,

2782
03:36:23,800 --> 03:36:30,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the concept of composite fee only measures the current cost of attendance.

2783
03:36:31,660 --> 03:36:31,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

2784
03:36:32,880 --> 03:36:39,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung magkano yung kailangan or yung gastos para sa pag-enroll ng isang studyante.

2785
03:36:40,760 --> 03:36:41,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

2786
03:36:41,060 --> 03:36:43,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The problem there is that,

2787
03:36:44,480 --> 03:36:46,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi lang yun ang kailangan.

2788
03:36:46,640 --> 03:36:48,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang mga State Universities and colleges.

2789
03:36:48,420 --> 03:36:49,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For example,

2790
03:36:49,540 --> 03:37:03,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: a composite fee would not cover the need for expansion or the addressing of infrastructure or personnel or other resource backlogs.

2791
03:37:04,520 --> 03:37:08,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya nga palaging issue po ng mga State Universities, capital outlay.

2792
03:37:09,780 --> 03:37:10,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

2793
03:37:10,800 --> 03:37:15,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Essentially, yung composite fee,

2794
03:37:15,400 --> 03:37:19,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Current maintenance and operations, yun ang kinukover nun.

2795
03:37:21,380 --> 03:37:26,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So yun po ang punto natin na hindi sapat.

2796
03:37:26,580 --> 03:37:44,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It's an inadequate tool to support the subsidy required by higher education institutions,

2797
03:37:44,900 --> 03:37:46,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particular state universities and colleges,

2798
03:37:47,340 --> 03:37:54,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to fully deliver on the mandate and fulfill the mandate of Republic Act 10931,

2799
03:37:54,520 --> 03:37:55,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: free higher education.

2800
03:37:56,580 --> 03:37:57,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun nga ang problema.

2801
03:37:59,100 --> 03:38:01,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil sa naging libre, lumalaki ang enrollment.

2802
03:38:02,200 --> 03:38:06,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At generally, ang policy ng mga state universities natin,

2803
03:38:07,600 --> 03:38:09,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hanggapin as much as possible.

2804
03:38:09,220 --> 03:38:14,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya nga po ngayon, ang lalaki na ng enrollment ng PUP notably,

2805
03:38:14,860 --> 03:38:18,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and I'm sure many other state universities and colleges,

2806
03:38:19,680 --> 03:38:20,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dumadami.

2807
03:38:20,480 --> 03:38:26,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And it's a good thing na dumadami ang enrollment sa ating state universities and colleges

2808
03:38:26,020 --> 03:38:29,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero hindi nakasasabay yung subsidy ng gobyerno.

2809
03:38:29,520 --> 03:38:32,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kailangan, para mabigyan sila ng quality education,

2810
03:38:33,100 --> 03:38:34,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kailangan may classroom.

2811
03:38:34,900 --> 03:38:37,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kailangan may dagdag na teacher.

2812
03:38:37,620 --> 03:38:41,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At yung teacher hindi pwedeng job order or contract of service.

2813
03:38:42,300 --> 03:38:45,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil mga highly qualified professionals ang mga ito.

2814
03:38:45,760 --> 03:38:47,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero wala. Bakit wala?

2815
03:38:47,860 --> 03:38:50,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil mali po yung instrumentong ginagamit.

2816
03:38:51,960 --> 03:38:53,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Every year, yan ang problema natin.

2817
03:38:55,140 --> 03:38:55,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong free...

2818
03:38:56,020 --> 03:38:58,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Free Higher Education Deficit.

2819
03:38:58,320 --> 03:38:59,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Deficiency.

2820
03:39:00,700 --> 03:39:04,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nasolved natin for fiscal year 2026.

2821
03:39:04,820 --> 03:39:06,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alam po yan ni Txera Grupies.

2822
03:39:06,240 --> 03:39:10,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagtulungan po ang CHED, Kongreso at PASOK.

2823
03:39:11,040 --> 03:39:15,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At nakapag-appropriate tayo ng additional 12 billion

2824
03:39:16,340 --> 03:39:20,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to pay for the 2022 to 2024 Free Higher Education Deficiency.

2825
03:39:21,280 --> 03:39:25,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero for 2026, meron na naman.

2826
03:39:25,540 --> 03:39:28,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And projected for 2027, 5 billion.

2827
03:39:28,660 --> 03:39:32,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As I will raise during the SUC hearing.

2828
03:39:32,780 --> 03:39:34,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang problema po yung instrumento.

2829
03:39:34,420 --> 03:39:36,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At mukhang yung instrumento na ginagamit nyo,

2830
03:39:37,040 --> 03:39:38,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: itong so-called composite fee,

2831
03:39:39,600 --> 03:39:41,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: palaging kakapusin yan.

2832
03:39:41,780 --> 03:39:42,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun po, madam.

2833
03:39:46,300 --> 03:39:47,180
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Sige po.

2834
03:39:48,760 --> 03:39:53,260
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Ang basis naman po nila for the composite fee

2835
03:39:53,260 --> 03:39:55,260
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: is under Section 55.

2836
03:39:55,540 --> 03:39:58,040
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Of RA 10931.

2837
03:39:58,680 --> 03:40:02,140
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, kaya naman po na umpisahan gamitin niyang composite fee.

2838
03:40:02,660 --> 03:40:05,480
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Now, seeing all of this,

2839
03:40:05,780 --> 03:40:08,700
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: knowing na may bigger budget is needed,

2840
03:40:08,860 --> 03:40:13,440
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: but of course, we are all working within a limited fiscal space.

2841
03:40:14,080 --> 03:40:16,020
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Pero, syempre, given the opportunity,

2842
03:40:16,520 --> 03:40:17,920
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: yan na naman talaga ang gusto.

2843
03:40:18,540 --> 03:40:21,620
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And knowing and finding out the root cause,

2844
03:40:22,160 --> 03:40:24,520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: there is now ATWG.

2845
03:40:24,520 --> 03:40:24,660
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And,

2846
03:40:24,660 --> 03:40:27,840
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: they are trying to find out,

2847
03:40:28,120 --> 03:40:31,900
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: really to check the faculty to student ratio.

2848
03:40:32,360 --> 03:40:34,820
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Kasi dun din naman yung nakikita nilang isang,

2849
03:40:35,820 --> 03:40:38,500
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: hindi siya standard for all SUCs.

2850
03:40:38,980 --> 03:40:39,780
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, it becomes,

2851
03:40:40,360 --> 03:40:41,500
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: because it's variable,

2852
03:40:42,280 --> 03:40:45,080
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: so budgeting also is affected by this.

2853
03:40:45,560 --> 03:40:45,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

2854
03:40:46,460 --> 03:40:47,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anyway, so as I said,

2855
03:40:48,060 --> 03:40:48,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: let me just reiterate,

2856
03:40:49,020 --> 03:40:51,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sinusuportahan po natin yung proposal ng CHED

2857
03:40:51,720 --> 03:40:54,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for an increase,

2858
03:40:54,660 --> 03:40:58,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: based on their plan.

2859
03:40:58,060 --> 03:40:59,540
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, the leveling up.

2860
03:41:00,000 --> 03:41:02,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Leveling up, yung tinatawag na leveling up,

2861
03:41:02,820 --> 03:41:08,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which requires an additional 4.2.

2862
03:41:08,420 --> 03:41:08,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

2863
03:41:08,940 --> 03:41:10,720
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: 4.2, initially, yes.

2864
03:41:10,940 --> 03:41:12,400
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: For the 106.

2865
03:41:12,580 --> 03:41:12,960
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes.

2866
03:41:13,320 --> 03:41:14,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, noted po yun.

2867
03:41:16,420 --> 03:41:17,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let me move on.

2868
03:41:18,140 --> 03:41:19,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, isa pa pong,

2869
03:41:20,300 --> 03:41:23,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: during this budget deliberation season,

2870
03:41:23,820 --> 03:41:24,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: isang,

2871
03:41:24,660 --> 03:41:26,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dinidiinan nating adbukasya

2872
03:41:26,600 --> 03:41:27,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay yung

2873
03:41:27,860 --> 03:41:30,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hustisya para sa mga Instructor 1

2874
03:41:30,920 --> 03:41:33,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa State Universities and Colleges.

2875
03:41:34,320 --> 03:41:37,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang requirement ng Instructor 1

2876
03:41:37,180 --> 03:41:40,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para mabigyan ka ng plantilya item

2877
03:41:40,020 --> 03:41:42,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay Master of Arts or Master of Science.

2878
03:41:44,120 --> 03:41:46,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa ibang mga hensya ng gobyerno,

2879
03:41:46,460 --> 03:41:48,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pagka may MA ka or MS,

2880
03:41:48,680 --> 03:41:50,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: minimum salary grade 16

2881
03:41:50,120 --> 03:41:52,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hanggang salary grade 18.

2882
03:41:52,540 --> 03:41:53,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa DepEd,

2883
03:41:54,660 --> 03:41:59,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Master Guidance Counselor

2884
03:41:59,100 --> 03:42:01,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na minimum dyan para lisensyado ka

2885
03:42:01,460 --> 03:42:03,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay Master of Arts.

2886
03:42:04,920 --> 03:42:06,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Salary grade 16 po yan.

2887
03:42:07,400 --> 03:42:09,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang Master Teacher ng DepEd,

2888
03:42:10,760 --> 03:42:12,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: minimum requirement din yung MA.

2889
03:42:13,660 --> 03:42:14,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Salary grade 18 ka.

2890
03:42:16,280 --> 03:42:20,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero sa State Universities and Colleges,

2891
03:42:20,940 --> 03:42:22,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: minimum requirement MA,

2892
03:42:22,400 --> 03:42:24,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: salary grade 12 ka lang.

2893
