Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagkakaroon din ng tulak ng CHED Memorandum Order para sa

4560
05:20:10,340 --> 05:20:14,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagpapatupad ng Bawal Bastos Law ay nakarating na po ito at

4561
05:20:14,380 --> 05:20:18,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: napapatupad sa lahat ng ating state universities and colleges.

4562
05:20:18,620 --> 05:20:21,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayan na lang po ang ating hihingin mula sa ating Distinguished

4563
05:20:21,160 --> 05:20:24,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sponsor at sa ating mga state universities and colleges at ang

4564
05:20:24,860 --> 05:20:30,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natin pong representasyon ay handa rin naman na magbuo ng mga

4565
05:20:30,240 --> 05:20:33,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: espasyo sa pakikipagtulungan. Halimbawa, sa Philippine Commission on

4566
05:20:33,740 --> 05:20:38,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Women, sila po ay may mandato na magbigay ng mga capacity building,

4567
05:20:38,920 --> 05:20:43,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: institutional development programs para tumulong sa compliance sa

4568
05:20:43,640 --> 05:20:48,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magna Carta of Women at lahat po ng mga batas na may kinalaman, hindi lang

4569
05:20:48,760 --> 05:20:54,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kababaihan, kundi po sa pagkamit ng tunay na mainstreaming

4570
05:20:54,860 --> 05:21:02,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at integration ng gender and development sa paggamit ng at least 5% na pondo

4571
05:21:02,300 --> 05:21:07,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating mga state universities and colleges. Maasahan po ba natin mula sa ating

4572
05:21:07,380 --> 05:21:12,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Distinguished Sponsor na titiyakin natin ang submission ng report tungkol sa

4573
05:21:12,320 --> 05:21:14,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: GAD compliance ng lahat ng SUCs?

4574
05:21:15,560 --> 05:21:24,040
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Yes, Mr. Speaker, our Distinguished Colleague. Nangako po ang CHED na sila po ay magbigay po ng

4575
05:21:24,860 --> 05:21:31,080
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: kasama po ang pasok ng impormasyon po ukol sa mga GAD activities po at

4576
05:21:31,080 --> 05:21:39,140
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: completion na kanilang, GAD compliance po na kanilang ang mga datos po na mayroon sila.

4577
05:21:39,140 --> 05:21:48,780
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At yung lingkod din po, patuloy din po ang aming suporta sa ating GAD initiatives

4578
05:21:48,780 --> 05:21:54,360
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: para po mas malawig po ang compliance ito sa CHED.

4579
05:21:54,860 --> 05:22:03,800
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At mga SUCs naman po natin ay batay po sa pag-relay po ng ating pasok president

4580
05:22:03,800 --> 05:22:09,940
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ay generally compliant po sa mga GAD activities at nina-nice po nila na ipakita po yung report

4581
05:22:09,940 --> 05:22:15,860
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ng lahat po ng kanilang mga SUCs ukol sa usapin po ng GAD.

4582
05:22:16,860 --> 05:22:24,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker. May nakuha rin po tayong output mula sa PCW.

4583
05:22:24,860 --> 05:22:31,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tungkol sa 2024 GAD utilization at nasabi nga po dito na sa state universities and colleges,

4584
05:22:32,080 --> 05:22:35,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa 6% naman yung spending nila para sa GAD.

4585
05:22:35,940 --> 05:22:42,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit nung sinilip po natin yung mga specificong aktividad kung saan po ito ginagastos,

4586
05:22:42,920 --> 05:22:51,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: marami pa rin ay halimbawa may kinalaman po sa observance ng 18-day campaign to end violence against women

4587
05:22:51,040 --> 05:22:54,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula November 25 hanggang December 12.

4588
05:22:54,860 --> 05:22:59,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nandiyan din po ang tungkol sa selebrasyon natin ng National Women's Month

4589
05:22:59,980 --> 05:23:09,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at nakita po natin na nananatili pa rin na separate from all other major programs ng SUCs ang ating GAD spending.

4590
05:23:09,340 --> 05:23:16,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ho, nararapat din na magkaroon tayo ng tuloy-tuloy na capacity building, institutional development,

4591
05:23:16,680 --> 05:23:22,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung focus sa organization mismo within the state universities and colleges.

4592
05:23:22,180 --> 05:23:24,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dalawang klase po kasi yan na maaari natin.

4593
05:23:24,860 --> 05:23:36,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung isa po ay nakafocus mismo sa organization ng ating mga SUCs at yung isa naman na maaari po na pagkagastusan

4594
05:23:36,760 --> 05:23:47,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nakatoon naman dun sa mismong stakeholders, ang constituency, at maaari din through extension services ng ating mga SUCs.

4595
05:23:47,020 --> 05:23:53,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yun po ang nais nating makita, natiyak ng mga activities, integration, hindi separation,

4596
05:23:54,860 --> 05:23:58,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: makakatulong ho ang pinakahuling ulat ng SUCs para dito.

4597
05:23:59,220 --> 05:24:03,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Mr. Speaker, nabanggit din po ng ating kasamahan kanina,

4598
05:24:03,980 --> 05:24:09,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: si Representative Perci Cendaña, yung tungkol po sa insidente sa Batangas State University.

4599
05:24:11,320 --> 05:24:16,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maaari po ba kayong magbigay ng update kung may ginawa ng aksyon ang BATSU tungkol dito?

4600
05:24:17,680 --> 05:24:24,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita ko rin po dun sa pinakahuling ulat ng PCW na ang Batangas State University po,

4601
05:24:24,040 --> 05:24:30,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang number one pagdating sa total GAD allocation sa fiscal year 2024.

4602
05:24:31,020 --> 05:24:34,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maaari po ba natin matiyak na pagdating dito sa GAD spending,

4603
05:24:35,560 --> 05:24:44,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang programa po natin nakatoon din dun sa mga gender-inclusive na mga policies

4604
05:24:44,020 --> 05:24:54,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at itiyakin po natin na hindi na mauulit ang kahit anong mga insidente na meron pong mga kaso ng diskriminasyon,

4605
05:24:54,040 --> 05:25:01,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o kaya nakakaramdam po ng hindi pagsali sa mga palisya ang ating mga estudyante.

4606
05:25:02,100 --> 05:25:05,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang ito para sa estudyante ginawang speaker, ginawang sponsor,

4607
05:25:05,980 --> 05:25:09,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero para rin sa ating faculty members, sa ating mga non-teaching personnel,

4608
05:25:10,160 --> 05:25:16,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: napakahalaga po na pag may ganitong kaso, hindi natin papayagan na muling mangyari sa ating mga campuses.

4609
05:25:17,520 --> 05:25:22,840
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Yes, to our distinguished colleague, ang presidente po ng Batangas State University,

4610
05:25:22,840 --> 05:25:23,600
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: kaya nangako po.

4611
05:25:24,040 --> 05:25:32,880
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Hindi na po mauulit ang mga ganitong insidente at asahan nyo daw po na ang kanilang mga polisya po patungkol sa GAD

4612
05:25:32,880 --> 05:25:37,780
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ay patuloy po nila ipapatupad at siguraduhin po na hanggang sa baba po sa implementation level

4613
05:25:37,780 --> 05:25:45,800
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ay hindi po magkakaroon ng hindi pagkakaunawa, hindi po malino na pagkakaintindi ang mga nag-implement po nito.

4614
05:25:45,800 --> 05:25:54,020
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At base po sa kanilang pinakahuling report ay ongoing na po yung administrative proceedings po patungkol doon.

4615
05:25:54,040 --> 05:26:06,120
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sa mga nabanggit po ng mga security guard po na allegedly sila po ang naging sanhi po ng itong mga gender-based mga violations

4616
05:26:06,120 --> 05:26:11,060
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: at patuloy po nilang ipapatupad po ang kanilang mga polisya patungkol po sa GAD.

4617
05:26:12,060 --> 05:26:18,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, nakalagay din sa CHED Memorandum Order na dapat tiyakin ang ating SUCs,

4618
05:26:18,080 --> 05:26:23,460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng lahat ng ating HEIs at sa ngayon nga po sa ating State University and Colleges,

4619
05:26:24,040 --> 05:26:31,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: merong konsultasyon pagdating sa mga estudyante, faculty, sa ating education stakeholders,

4620
05:26:31,800 --> 05:26:38,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang lahat po ng mga polisya na hindi lang gender-sensitive pero nakalagay din po doon disability-sensitive,

4621
05:26:38,680 --> 05:26:42,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung mga policies natin towards inclusion, dapat may konsultasyon.

4622
05:26:42,860 --> 05:26:47,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maasahan po ba natin ito sa ating mga State Universities and Colleges?

4623
05:26:52,700 --> 05:26:53,860
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Ah, ano po, pinapangako po nila

4624
05:26:54,040 --> 05:26:58,300
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na yung konsultasyon po na ito, hindi lamang po sa mga estudyante,

4625
05:26:58,460 --> 05:27:04,280
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: kundi pati po sa mga kanilang magulang at pati na rin po sa mga guro na mga kasama po sa pamantasan.

4626
05:27:05,560 --> 05:27:09,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat kayo noong Speaker at sa akin din pong kananasan,

4627
05:27:09,240 --> 05:27:15,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang halimbawa na integrate po yung GAD mandate sa orientation,

4628
05:27:17,340 --> 05:27:23,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pag-offer ng mga gender-sensitivity trainings para sa mga org na nagpaparegister,

4629
05:27:24,040 --> 05:27:30,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kanilang mga campuses, sa kanilang mga eskwelahan, sa hiring ng faculty, non-teaching personnel,

4630
05:27:31,140 --> 05:27:40,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lahat po yan, dapat po sa lahat ng level ng ating pamantasan ay may ganitong tipo ng tuloy-tuloy na training at capacity building.

4631
05:27:40,760 --> 05:27:47,460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nakikita ko po dito, Philippine Normal University, isa din po sa mga pinakaaktibo na nagtitrain,

4632
05:27:47,460 --> 05:27:52,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi lang po sa ating mga kapwa-SUCs, pero sa iba't-ibang mga sektor,

4633
05:27:54,040 --> 05:28:03,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: maaari silang makaabot para po sa tunay na inklusibo na edukasyon sa lahat ng antas ng ating sistema ng edukasyon.

4634
05:28:03,260 --> 05:28:09,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, ganun din sa University of the Philippines, meron pong Diliman Gender Office,

4635
05:28:09,580 --> 05:28:20,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: merong Office on Anti-Sexual Harassment, ang kanila pong OWASH.

4636
05:28:21,260 --> 05:28:23,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yun po yung hangad natin na sana makita din.

4637
05:28:24,040 --> 05:28:24,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang ating SUC.

4638
05:28:24,720 --> 05:28:30,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sigurado po ako, marami pang SUCs na may ganun tipo ng mga focal systems,

4639
05:28:30,520 --> 05:28:35,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ganun tipo ng mga spesipiko na mga centers at offices,

4640
05:28:35,500 --> 05:28:39,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at hangad natin gano'ng speaker na dapat may pondo ang lahat ng ito.

4641
05:28:39,640 --> 05:28:48,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya muli, dapat ma-restore yung mga MOOE budget cuts ng ating mga state universities and colleges.

4642
05:28:48,640 --> 05:28:53,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayun din po, dapat pag-aralan ng kapulungan na ito kung paano pa tataasan,

4643
05:28:54,040 --> 05:28:58,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung nailaan na capital outlay budget para sa ating mga SUCs.

4644
05:28:58,900 --> 05:29:05,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May hirapan po tayong magawa yung mandato sa universal access to quality tertiary education

4645
05:29:05,640 --> 05:29:14,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung hindi po sasabay na papalawakin din yung capacity ng mga SUCs na tumanggap ng mas maraming mga scholar ng bayan,

4646
05:29:15,140 --> 05:29:22,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mas maraming mga faculty members na nagiging regular at nagkakaroon ng security of tenure sa kanilang mga trabaho.

4647
05:29:23,120 --> 05:29:24,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahirap po yung gawin.

4648
05:29:24,040 --> 05:29:32,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung tuloy-tuloy ang pagdaltas ng kanilang pondo at kung hindi natin dadagdagan ang kanilang pondo para sa capital outlay at personal services.

4649
05:29:32,700 --> 05:29:36,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat gano'ng speaker. Maraming salamat, distinguished sponsor.

4650
05:29:37,180 --> 05:29:39,220
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you, the Honorable Elago, Majority Leader.

4651
05:29:40,120 --> 05:29:45,000
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Dada Kiram Ismula for her interpellation.

4652
05:29:45,780 --> 05:29:52,180
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The Honorable Dada Kiram Ismula, a portalist, Akbayan is recognized. Please proceed.

4653
05:29:54,040 --> 05:29:57,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As-salamu alaykum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu.

4654
05:29:58,080 --> 05:30:00,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor

4655
05:30:00,000 --> 05:30:22,860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I just have a few general questions addressed to all our SUCs. Una, in accordance with the Higher Education Modernization Act, ano ang compliance rate of our SUCs on the inclusion of students' councils or students' regents in the Board of Regents or Board of Trustees?

4656
05:30:22,860 --> 05:30:28,120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Meron ba sa mga SUCs natin ang non-compliant pa rin dito?

4657
05:30:30,000 --> 05:30:49,360
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, ano po, ang 100% po ang compliance rate na ni-report po ng ating pasok sa ating mga state universities and colleges?

4658
05:30:50,020 --> 05:30:59,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, maaari bang maibigay ng ating mga SUCs ang compliance rate nila sa creation of committees?

4659
05:31:00,000 --> 05:31:18,500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: on Decorum and Investigation, o CODI, to investigate sexual harassment cases in accordance with the Safe Spaces Act. Meron ba na as of now ay non-compliant pa rin dito?

4660
05:31:18,500 --> 05:31:29,960
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sa ngayon po, sila po ay nag-report na sila po ay generally compliant. Pero sila po ay willing magbigay po ng impormasyon po sa inyong tanggapan

4661
05:31:29,980 --> 05:31:42,820
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: patungkol po sa mga detalye po ng bawat state universities and colleges po patungkol po sa kanilang compliance po sa inyong hinihingi.

4662
05:31:43,500 --> 05:31:46,260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Distinguished Sponsor.

4663
05:31:46,860 --> 05:31:57,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, this representation would like to request a compliance report from our SUCs on how they are implementing provisions

4664
05:31:57,300 --> 05:32:08,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: supporting students with disabilities and priority for poor families under the Universal Access to Quality Tertiary Education Act.

4665
05:32:09,140 --> 05:32:14,100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can our SUCs provide this report before the second reading of the GAB?

4666
05:32:16,100 --> 05:32:27,180
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Before po on second reading, they will be able to furnish you a copy po. They have the data po and they will be very much willing po to provide you along with the earlier request po.

4667
05:32:27,300 --> 05:32:28,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

4668
05:32:29,060 --> 05:32:41,500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, can the SUCs also commit to provide a report on the enrollment rate, dropout rate, and performance of students from the indigenous people sector?

4669
05:32:41,500 --> 05:32:41,720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Thank you, sir.

4670
05:32:50,560 --> 05:32:54,160
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Ang CHED po ay may informasyon po patungkol po diyan.

4671
05:32:54,860 --> 05:32:56,820
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At sila rin po ay mag-furnish po ng copy.

4672
05:32:57,300 --> 05:33:01,380
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Copy sa inyong tanggapan po patungkol sa mga dropout rates po.

4673
05:33:01,980 --> 05:33:02,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po, no?

4674
05:33:03,320 --> 05:33:13,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kanina po, during the CHED budget deliberation, naitanong ko rin po ito at inomit din po ng CHED na magbibigay din po sila ng datos na to

4675
05:33:13,000 --> 05:33:15,360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: dahil ongoing pa nga daw po.

4676
05:33:15,360 --> 05:33:24,380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At last year, nag-commit din ang CHED na magre-release sila ng memorandum sa mga SUCs na patungkol dito.

4677
05:33:24,580 --> 05:33:26,840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya naman po, naitanong din natin ito.

4678
05:33:27,300 --> 05:33:30,100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At hihintayin po ng aking opisina ito.

4679
05:33:30,840 --> 05:33:40,320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, how do our SUCs ensure that they are compliant with CHED Memorandum Order No. 2, Series of 2019,

4680
05:33:40,320 --> 05:33:44,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: which requires the integration of IP studies?

4681
05:33:45,060 --> 05:33:50,700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Meron bang available na data ang mga SUCs showing compliance to this memorandum?

4682
05:33:57,300 --> 05:34:10,300
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Mula po ng tanggap po ng ating mga SUCs and CHED Memorandum No. 2 po patungkol nga po sa mga IPs natin.

4683
05:34:10,300 --> 05:34:21,600
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At sila naman po ay nagkaroon ng, sila po ay nabigyan ng payo po na mag-observe po ng compliance po.

4684
05:34:23,340 --> 05:34:25,180
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Kasama na po yung mga application po.

4685
05:34:25,420 --> 05:34:26,300
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Pag-identify po ng ating mga...

4686
05:34:27,300 --> 05:34:34,340
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: kasama po ng mga indigenous communities sa kanilang mga application po sa ating mga SUCs.

4687
05:34:34,960 --> 05:34:42,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, I would look forward to all the data I have requested from our SUCs

4688
05:34:42,960 --> 05:34:48,620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: before we proceed with the second reading of our House Bill No. 10858.

4689
05:34:48,860 --> 05:34:51,380
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sa inyo po yan, Madam Speaker.

4690
05:34:51,980 --> 05:34:57,180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, regarding naman po sa capital outlays,

4691
05:34:57,300 --> 05:35:00,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng Polytechnic University of the Philippines o PUP,

4692
05:35:01,520 --> 05:35:04,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: from our consultation with the students of the PUP,

4693
05:35:04,960 --> 05:35:09,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 2 to 3 years delayed na ang north wing building ng PUP.

4694
05:35:11,240 --> 05:35:19,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: However, sa COA report, may 106 million pesos unreleased capital outlay for 2025.

4695
05:35:20,140 --> 05:35:24,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can you illustrate paano i-utilize ang north wing building?

4696
05:35:57,300 --> 05:36:01,040
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague,

4697
05:36:01,800 --> 05:36:08,480
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: base po sa update, the PUP north wing project is being implemented by DPWH.

4698
05:36:09,100 --> 05:36:17,540
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: So the funds were directly given to DPWH by the national government under our General Appropriations Act.

4699
05:36:18,100 --> 05:36:24,220
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: So the unreleased capital outlay for 2025 is still with the DPWH.

4700
05:36:24,220 --> 05:36:27,220
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: But the intent po...

4701
05:36:27,300 --> 05:36:40,500
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: They were able to acquire 164 million funding under the 2026 budget.

4702
05:36:40,940 --> 05:36:51,400
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: And they were able to bid out the project.

4703
05:36:51,400 --> 05:36:56,400
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: And the DPWH was able to...

4704
05:36:57,300 --> 05:36:58,380
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: implement this.

4705
05:36:58,740 --> 05:37:01,300
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: And as of now po, they still need...

4706
05:37:03,780 --> 05:37:06,220
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Ang ano po, there was actually a failure of bidding.

4707
05:37:06,960 --> 05:37:09,600
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At hindi po na-implement ang project.

4708
05:37:09,940 --> 05:37:14,680
