Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We cannot say with confidence that there is a solution to the DOE crisis when communities continue to face power interruptions at i-entertain pa natin itong Paxilica initiative na may napakalaking iniasahang konsumo ng kuryente.

8255
08:01:25,320 --> 08:01:38,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So sa atin, Mr. Speaker, Gunsponsor, this representation urges the DOE to essentially also provide its recommendations kung ano po ba ang priorities na dapat tugunan when it comes to usaping energy.

8256
