Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, malubha na ang kalagayan ng ating kalikasan, ang pag-i-entertain ng waste to energy facilities on top of yung in-entertain nating Pax Silica Initiative,

8282
