Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay mas makakasira pa po nito.

8283
08:04:05,680 --> 08:04:10,520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Because, at the end of the day, WTE facilities will only contribute to the larger environment.

8284
08:04:10,740 --> 08:04:17,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Environmental destruction happening around the world, whether it is by encouraging the continuous creation of goods,

8285
