9160
09:11:24,080 --> 09:11:27,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: When in fact, dapat baligtad yun,

9161
09:11:27,080 --> 09:11:31,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: si ASPA ang billionist dahil sa mga forced outages,

9162
09:11:31,080 --> 09:11:35,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: dapat si reserve market ang maliit.

9163
09:11:35,080 --> 09:11:37,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero doon nga nila binato lahat

9164
09:11:37,080 --> 09:11:40,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi mas malaki ang kita nila.

9165
09:11:40,080 --> 09:11:42,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, again, recommendation,

9166
09:11:42,080 --> 09:11:45,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kindly revisit the circular on reserve market.

9167
09:11:45,080 --> 09:11:46,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we will revisit that.

9168
09:11:46,080 --> 09:11:49,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we will revisit the circular of the reserve market

9169
09:11:49,080 --> 09:11:52,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and even the ancillary, Mr. Speaker.

9170
09:11:52,080 --> 09:11:57,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, another recommendation.

9171
09:11:57,080 --> 09:12:03,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maybe ginawa na to ng DOE, pero sasabihin ko pa rin.

9172
09:12:03,080 --> 09:12:06,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung mga planta sa Visayas,

9173
09:12:06,080 --> 09:12:09,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kailangan tayo magkaroon ng inventory.

9174
09:12:09,080 --> 09:12:14,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: And even in Mindanao, hindi lang yung installed.

9175
09:12:14,080 --> 09:12:18,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: You make an inventory on the installed capacity

9176
09:12:18,080 --> 09:12:21,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: and yung dependable capacity.

9177
09:12:21,080 --> 09:12:23,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi magkaiba po yung dalawa.

9178
09:12:23,080 --> 09:12:25,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alam nating lahat yun.

9179
09:12:25,080 --> 09:12:27,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nag-installed ka ng 100 mega,

9180
09:12:27,080 --> 09:12:29,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pero ano yung dependable?

9181
09:12:29,080 --> 09:12:30,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Baka 20 na lang.

9182
09:12:30,080 --> 09:12:33,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi luma na ng mga planta.

9183
09:12:33,080 --> 09:12:37,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya mali-mali yung projection na ginagamit natin.

9184
09:12:37,080 --> 09:12:42,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

9185
09:12:42,080 --> 09:12:43,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi na kailangan sagutin.

9186
09:12:43,080 --> 09:12:48,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi sabi ko, baka nga ginawa na ng DOE yun.

9187
09:12:48,080 --> 09:12:50,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi ang kasunod diyan,

9188
09:12:50,080 --> 09:12:55,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: inventory ng ating transmission facilities.

9189
09:12:55,080 --> 09:13:01,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Saan ba sa ating transmission facilities

9190
09:13:01,080 --> 09:13:07,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang kaya pang mag-absorb ng additional capacity

9191
09:13:07,080 --> 09:13:10,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na hindi na kailangan i-upgrade?

9192
09:13:10,080 --> 09:13:12,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: This is in connection,

9193
09:13:12,080 --> 09:13:14,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sa renewable na i-infuse natin,

9194
09:13:14,080 --> 09:13:17,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na gusto nating i-dagdag.

9195
09:13:17,080 --> 09:13:19,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi kung, to avoid,

9196
09:13:19,080 --> 09:13:25,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: to avoid yung upgrading ng transmission line,

9197
09:13:25,080 --> 09:13:27,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pag-inject ng renewable,

9198
09:13:27,080 --> 09:13:30,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: dapat may inventory na tayo.

9199
09:13:30,080 --> 09:13:33,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Aling banda, for example, sa Visayas,

9200
09:13:33,080 --> 09:13:35,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nasa Iloilo ba?

9201
09:13:35,080 --> 09:13:37,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: O nasa Negros ba?

9202
09:13:37,080 --> 09:13:40,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung upgraded na nalinyan ng NGCP,

9203
09:13:40,080 --> 09:13:42,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na maliit lang yun.

9204
09:13:42,080 --> 09:13:47,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon natin ituro ang mga,

9205
09:13:47,080 --> 09:13:50,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang mga developer,

9206
09:13:50,080 --> 09:13:53,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mga supplier ng renewable.

9207
09:13:53,080 --> 09:13:55,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon kayo mag-put up,

9208
09:13:55,080 --> 09:14:00,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi maluwag pa yung transmission doon.

9209
09:14:00,080 --> 09:14:03,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pwede pa niyang i-absorb yung capacity ninyo

9210
09:14:03,080 --> 09:14:07,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na wala tayong gasto sa upgrading ng linya.

9211
09:14:07,080 --> 09:14:13,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ginawa na ba ng DOE yan?

9212
09:14:13,080 --> 09:14:15,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

9213
09:14:15,080 --> 09:14:18,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sigurado kayo?

9214
09:14:18,080 --> 09:14:20,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

9215
09:14:20,080 --> 09:14:28,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alam ko na hindi ninyo masagot yan.

9216
09:14:28,080 --> 09:14:33,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi sa ngayon, pinabayaan ninyo kung saan saan.

9217
09:14:33,080 --> 09:14:36,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sila ang, sila lang ang nagdesisyon.

9218
09:14:36,080 --> 09:14:38,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung saan nila ilagay.

9219
09:14:38,080 --> 09:14:42,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Resulta, kung malayo sa transmission yan,

9220
09:14:42,080 --> 09:14:45,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: gagastos na naman tayo ng Thailand.

9221
09:14:45,080 --> 09:14:47,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Gagawa na naman tayo ng linya,

9222
09:14:47,080 --> 09:14:49,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: madidili na naman sila,

9223
09:14:49,080 --> 09:14:52,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kung madili yung approval ng ARC,

9224
09:14:52,080 --> 09:14:54,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kung may linya na,

9225
09:14:54,080 --> 09:14:57,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: magbabayad na naman tayo sa transmission, Sir.

9226
09:14:57,080 --> 09:15:00,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We're doing that already, Mr. Speaker.

9227
09:15:00,000 --> 09:15:17,540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I hope na hindi tayo nagsasayang ng ano dito kasi kanina talagang sinadya kong magpahuli because I'm taking notes of the discussion, dinirekta ko na policy recommendation.

9228
09:15:17,760 --> 09:15:23,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Marami tayong magagawa, mapababa natin yung presyo without the need of legislation.

9229
09:15:24,160 --> 09:15:27,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: But we must admit na kailangan natin i-legislate.

9230
09:15:27,600 --> 09:15:37,320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: For example, sa ancillary, we are always at the mercy of the private sector dahil sa section 47 na yan.

9231
09:15:38,100 --> 09:15:50,340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, palaging tinuturo ng ating mamamayan ay palpak na naman yung DOE na yan dahil it is beyond your control.

9232
09:15:50,340 --> 09:15:53,780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nasa portfolio na ganito pero hindi nagtayo.

9233
09:15:54,320 --> 09:15:57,540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ang dapat sa ancillary,

9234
09:15:57,600 --> 09:16:00,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: within our control yung planta.

9235
09:16:00,420 --> 09:16:09,620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: The only way to do that, kahit initially, Luzon, Visayas, Mindanao, na main grid, may isang planta man lang ang napukor.

9236
09:16:10,540 --> 09:16:19,020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, para may pabalik yung napukor sa generation, ancillary, hindi naman libre yun, babayaran naman ang gobyerno niyan.

9237
09:16:19,640 --> 09:16:23,100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: We must amend section 47 of IPIRA.

9238
09:16:23,720 --> 09:16:26,660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kindly support that amendment, DOE.

9239
09:16:27,600 --> 09:16:35,480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, mapabilis, one-time subsidy ng gobyerno, other countries, highly subsidized, tayo, true cost.

9240
09:16:36,260 --> 09:16:41,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kahit ibalik lang natin one-time subsidy pag tayo ng planta, operation and maintenance, as pa na.

9241
09:16:43,160 --> 09:16:45,040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Isang business lang tayo gagastos.

9242
09:16:45,040 --> 09:16:47,380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I totally agree with Congressman Sergio Dago.

9243
09:16:48,260 --> 09:16:51,840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: If I can recommend also, since last term na po ni Congressman Dago,

9244
09:16:52,180 --> 09:16:55,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pagkatapos ng term niya, dapat po pumasok sa DOE.

9245
09:16:57,600 --> 09:17:01,400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ito, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

9246
09:17:01,560 --> 09:17:07,460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: No, it's no joke. I mean, with all due respect, alam na alam po ni Congressman Dago.

9247
09:17:08,160 --> 09:17:12,240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Nagsimula, lineman, ngayong congressman, now we're talking about policy.

9248
09:17:12,780 --> 09:17:15,860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, malaki po ang may tutulong talaga ni Congressman Dago.

9249
09:17:15,980 --> 09:17:21,140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: That's why we are very supportive sa mga suggestions ni Congressman Sergio Dago.

9250
09:17:21,980 --> 09:17:24,380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: More than the Congressman Presley Dessos.

9251
09:17:25,120 --> 09:17:26,660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

9252
09:17:27,600 --> 09:17:34,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Policy recommendation, magkahalo ito on Friday sa DOF-PIR.

9253
09:17:35,280 --> 09:17:36,100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magkahalo ito.

9254
09:17:36,700 --> 09:17:43,720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, kung napapansin natin, kagaya ng oil, sa issue kanina natin sa fuel,

9255
09:17:44,780 --> 09:17:50,260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pag tumaas yung oil, tataas lalo dahil naka-fix yung rate natin sa VAT.

9256
09:17:51,980 --> 09:17:55,260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nag-file na kami ng bill sa kuryente.

9257
09:17:55,260 --> 09:18:02,540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nagkakuryente, pag tumaas yung generation component, yun lang naman ang palaging gumagalaw, yung generation.

9258
09:18:04,240 --> 09:18:09,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tumataas din lalo dahil naka-fix 12% yung VAT.

9259
09:18:09,600 --> 09:18:14,420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: We have filed a bill, no, na kung walang suporta ang Department of Energy,

9260
09:18:15,140 --> 09:18:19,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: baka hindi din gagalaw si BIR, DOF, no.

9261
09:18:21,140 --> 09:18:24,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Halimbawa, kung ang...

9262
09:18:25,260 --> 09:18:37,980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: basis natin sa projected natin na taxes na makukulikta sa VAT on electricity ay 1 billion sa susunod na taon.

9263
09:18:38,540 --> 09:18:46,000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Definitely, may ginagamit na benchmark si BIR na ito yung kilowatt-hour sales for the year,

9264
09:18:46,740 --> 09:18:50,340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ito yung amount per kilowatt-hour.

9265
09:18:50,340 --> 09:18:54,520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung halimbawa, coal-fired yan.

9266
09:18:55,260 --> 09:18:56,120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Na-planta.

9267
09:18:56,840 --> 09:19:02,100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos, ang basis ni BIR ay 8 pesos per kilowatt-hour.

9268
09:19:02,100 --> 09:19:13,860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, pag tumaas yan, magiging 10, minsan 12, magduduble yung makukulikta na value-added tax.

9269
09:19:14,060 --> 09:19:16,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, tumaas nga, kagaya ng oil.

9270
09:19:17,180 --> 09:19:21,100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, may proposal kami na win-win solusyon.

9271
09:19:22,180 --> 09:19:24,500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi mawawalan si government.

9272
09:19:25,140 --> 09:19:25,180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kukulikta.

9273
09:19:25,260 --> 09:19:28,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kukuliktahin pa rin niya yung nakabasis sa benchmark.

9274
09:19:28,480 --> 09:19:32,400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ERC should insure benchmark lahat ng technology.

9275
09:19:33,060 --> 09:19:37,100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, nakakap siya sa benchmark, yan yung itax.

9276
09:19:37,380 --> 09:19:40,980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero pag tumaas na siya, ilibre na yung taas.

9277
09:19:41,100 --> 09:19:45,920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung sa oil naman, kung ang benchmark natin sa diesel ay 60 per liter,

9278
09:19:46,600 --> 09:19:51,320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pag umabot na ng 140 yan, huwag nang itax yung up to 140.

9279
09:19:51,940 --> 09:19:54,240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi lalong kawawa yung ating mamamayan.

9280
09:19:54,240 --> 09:19:55,220
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: In effect,

9281
09:19:55,980 --> 09:20:06,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nakukulikta pa rin ni government yung kanyang projected na revenue out of that particular commodity.

9282
09:20:07,760 --> 09:20:10,800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: But at the same time, natulungan niya yung inflation.

9283
09:20:11,380 --> 09:20:12,640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi lalong tataas.

9284
09:20:12,880 --> 09:20:13,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Why?

9285
09:20:13,700 --> 09:20:17,380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pagdating sa kuryente, may domino effect siya.

9286
09:20:17,940 --> 09:20:20,800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, ginagamit natin lahat kuryente.

9287
09:20:21,980 --> 09:20:23,800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Noon, it's only...

9288
09:20:25,260 --> 09:20:29,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ano yung ating three basic needs noon?

9289
09:20:30,820 --> 09:20:32,740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Food, shelter, and clothing.

9290
09:20:33,360 --> 09:20:36,300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ngayon kasi, electricity, food, shelter, clothing na.

9291
09:20:37,040 --> 09:20:41,800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, yung kuryente, ginagamit na to produce bakal.

9292
09:20:42,820 --> 09:20:46,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: To produce food.

9293
09:20:47,900 --> 09:20:50,820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pag tumaas yung kuryente, tataas yung production cost.

9294
09:20:51,640 --> 09:20:54,820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ngayon, kung maibaba natin yung...

9295
09:20:55,260 --> 09:20:57,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung value added tax,

9296
09:20:57,720 --> 09:21:01,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: bababa yung ano, makakahikaya tayo ng investor.

9297
09:21:02,120 --> 09:21:04,340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: That has been admitted by DIPNIB

9298
09:21:04,340 --> 09:21:07,940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na isa sa balakid, yung mataas na presyo ng kuryente.

9299
09:21:07,940 --> 09:21:10,440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, kaya hanapan natin ang paraan.

9300
09:21:11,040 --> 09:21:13,200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Marami tayong mariresolve na problema

9301
09:21:13,200 --> 09:21:16,520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kung mariresolve natin ang presyo ng kuryente

9302
09:21:16,520 --> 09:21:19,640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at yung reliability ng kuryente natin.

9303
09:21:20,300 --> 09:21:23,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Napaka-basic na example,

9304
09:21:23,900 --> 09:21:24,940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung hindi natin mahagip.

9305
09:21:25,260 --> 09:21:26,180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sa ating projection.

9306
09:21:27,120 --> 09:21:31,000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung pinag-didibatihan na naman yun na Pax Silica.

9307
09:21:31,440 --> 09:21:32,580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pumasok ba yun sa PIP?

9308
09:21:33,700 --> 09:21:34,040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi!

9309
09:21:35,360 --> 09:21:35,620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Diba?

9310
09:21:36,000 --> 09:21:37,420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bigla na lang darating dito,

9311
09:21:38,200 --> 09:21:38,940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: magtayo kami.

9312
09:21:39,580 --> 09:21:41,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya ang katanungan kaagad,

9313
09:21:42,100 --> 09:21:43,520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: saan tayo kukuha ng tubig?

9314
09:21:43,700 --> 09:21:45,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Saan tayo kukuha ng kuryente?

9315
09:21:45,860 --> 09:21:49,540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: That's the reason yung number one na recommendation ko kanina

9316
09:21:49,540 --> 09:21:52,380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: involve this board of investment,

9317
09:21:52,900 --> 09:21:53,840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung mga ganyan.

9318
09:21:53,840 --> 09:21:54,460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi doon,

9319
09:21:54,460 --> 09:21:56,160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sila unang,

9320
09:21:56,980 --> 09:21:58,480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: then going back to the tax,

9321
09:21:59,080 --> 09:22:00,640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: we must review the tax.

9322
09:22:01,300 --> 09:22:02,880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sa panggatong pa lang,

9323
09:22:03,160 --> 09:22:03,440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: coal,

9324
09:22:04,020 --> 09:22:05,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pagdating sa Bureau of Customs,

9325
09:22:05,860 --> 09:22:06,860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Customs Duties,

9326
09:22:07,360 --> 09:22:08,320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: bago mailabas,

9327
09:22:08,640 --> 09:22:09,340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: excise tax.

9328
09:22:09,920 --> 09:22:11,160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pagdating sa planta,

9329
09:22:11,500 --> 09:22:12,260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: igatong mo,

9330
09:22:12,680 --> 09:22:13,280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: lalabas,

9331
09:22:13,820 --> 09:22:14,780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 1 kilowatt hour.

9332
09:22:15,340 --> 09:22:17,400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung 1 kilowatt hour generation charge,

9333
09:22:17,720 --> 09:22:18,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 12% na VAT.

9334
09:22:19,340 --> 09:22:21,780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magta-travel siya sa transmission

9335
09:22:21,780 --> 09:22:24,400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: bago makarating sa distribution.

9336
09:22:24,400 --> 09:22:26,400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Transmission charge, 12%.

9337
09:22:26,400 --> 09:22:28,400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pagdating sa distribution,

9338
09:22:28,400 --> 09:22:33,400
